<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Alert: Unsafe Valve Operation</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 5px;">
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <img src="{{logoUrl}}" alt="Abitto Energy" style="max-width: 150px;">
        </div>
        <h2 style="color: #f0ad4e; text-align: center;">Alert: Unsafe Valve Operation</h2>
        <p>Hello Admin,</p>
        <p>An attempt was made to OPEN the valve for a meter while a leak is still marked as UNRESOLVED.</p>
        <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <tr>
                <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; font-weight: bold;">Meter Number:</td>
                <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">{{meterNumber}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; font-weight: bold;">Device ID:</td>
                <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">{{deviceId}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; font-weight: bold;">Performed By User (ID):</td>
                <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">{{userId}}</td>
            </tr>
        </table>
        <p style="background-color: #fcf8e3; color: #8a6d3b; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #faebcc;">
            <strong>Warning:</strong> If this was a manual request from the device, it indicates the valve may be open despite a known leak hazard.
        </p>
        <p>Please check the safety status of this meter immediately.</p>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
            <a href="{{adminUrl}}" style="background-color: #337ab7; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;">View Leak Reports</a>
        </div>
        <hr style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #777; text-align: center;">&copy; 2024 Abitto Energy. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
